&lt;p&gt;Yuri Gordon (Юрий Гордон) is a &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131013005010/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Russia"&gt;Russian&lt;/a&gt; designer and author of « &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131013005010/http:/store.artlebedev.com/catalog/books/design/kniga_pro_bykvy/"&gt;Книга про буквы от Аа до Яя&lt;/a&gt;» ( &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131013005010/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Book%20of%20Letters%20From%20%D0%90%D0%B0%20to%20%D0%AF%D1%8F"&gt;Book of Letters From Аа to Яя&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;. Yuri is also principal of the Moscow-based &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131013005010/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Letterhead%20Studio"&gt;Letterhead Studio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
